---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---
<div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col px-4 mt-40 lg:mt-44 ">
    <section class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-7 relative overflow-hidden">

        <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 
            w-[500px] h-[500px] md:w-[700px] md:h-[700px]
            -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2
            bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(168,85,247,0.4),transparent_50%)]
            blur-3xl z-0 pointer-events-none">
        </div>

        <h1 class="max-w-5xl font-Anton text-white  lg:text-8xl text-5xl text-center">
            DISEÑO Y DESARROLLO WEB RÁPIDO, 
            <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-primary-light via-primary-dark  to-primary-light
            bg-size-[300%_300%]
            bg-clip-text text-transparent
            animate-gradiente" >
            FUNCIONAL Y OPTIMIZADO
        </span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray text-center max-w-2xl font-medium">
            Desarrollamos sitios web modernos, rápidos y optimizados para SEO, diseñados para proyectar profesionalismo, ofrecer una experiencia fluida y fortalecer tu presencia digital.
        </p>

        <a href="/contactanos"
        class="bg-primary-dark flex gap-4 items-center justify-center px-12 py-3.5 
        text-white font-Anton text-sm lg:text-base 
        rounded-2xl hover:rounded-4xl hover:bg-primary-light hover:text-black 
        transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out">

            <Icon name="ic:baseline-whatsapp" 
            class="size-7 transition-transform duration-500 
            group-hover:rotate-12 group-hover:text-black" />

            Solicita una Cotización
        </a>


</div>


